file active-designing/20260909-005121_the-pier-a-newcomer-stands-up.md which host and in which order, register 100
scope one CLI bumped, one editor bumped, one room reclassified by template, one rule and two pages seated
status GREEN on sow_witness, the infuse check against live, living-docs lint and the pin bounds; kakoune and codex both verified on metal after the rebuild
